cx:eng_alotofPLUSNconstruction_Meaning a rcxn:ConstructionMeaning ;
    rcxn:hasMeaning "The construction expresses a contextually large, unspecified number or amount. It can quantify plural count nouns (a lot of people) and mass nouns (a lot of water). In this use, a lot of functions as a complex quantifier rather than referring to a literal/source lot, parcel, or portion." .

