membr:Project_Khanoub_2610191625_F2610191625 a rsrch:Finding ;
    RDFS:label "The construction shows a clear shift from predominantly lexical/literal uses towards more generalized quantification. While earlier historical uses often retain source meanings, later examples increasingly express well-established generalized quantity." ;
    rsrch:basedOn cx:eng_alotofPLUSNconstruction .

