references:8991a2c6-5ff5-43b4-9d91-939c06413083_3 evid:biblio "Brems, L. (2012). The establishment of quantifier constructions for size nouns: A diachronic case study of heap(s) and lot(s). Journal of Historical Pragmatics, 13(2), 202–231." .
references:8991a2c6-5ff5-43b4-9d91-939c06413083_4 evid:biblio "Langacker, R. W. (2010). A lot of quantifiers. In S. Rice & J. Newman (Eds.), Empirical and experimental methods in cognitive/functional research (pp. 41–57). CSLI Publications." .
